Nether's Delight Refabricated for Horizon 26.3 (version 4.1.1-horizon.3)

A port of Nether's Delight Refabricated 1.20.1-4.1.1 by RaymondBlaze, a Fabric port and fork of
Nether's Delight by Umpaz, SoyTutta and Sammy.
Original source: https://github.com/DragonsPlusMinecraft/NethersDelightRefabricated
Upstream project: https://github.com/Chefs-Delight/NethersDelight_Forge
Original licence: LGPL-2.1-only (the Refabricated project as a whole); MIT (the upstream project)

Ported to Horizon by lavoide: a content package (no code). The items, blocks, textures, models and data
are carried over from the original jar and converted to Horizon's content format. Its stove, furnaces,
feast, plants, soils and loot run on the farmersdelight package (Farmer's Delight for Horizon) 0.5 or
later, which it needs. This port is distributed under the same licence as the original,
LGPL-2.1-only; the licence text is in LICENSE (the jar's LICENSE_FABRIC). The upstream project's MIT
licence is in LICENSE-FORGE (the jar's LICENSE_FORGE). The package is its own source.

The jar's LICENSING.md says:

  This project, Nether's Delight Refabricated is a Fabric port and fork of Nether's Delight
  (https://github.com/Chefs-Delight/NethersDelight_Forge). The upstream project, Nether's Delight, is
